      {
        "id": "en.n8.c69.e04",
        "format": "escribir",
        "prompt": {
          "es": "Escribe la escena de recuerdo que se pide en el recuadro."
        },
        "answer": {
          "text": "I remember standing on my grandmother's porch on hot summer evenings. The air was warm, and the scent of fresh bread came from the kitchen. I can still hear the creak of the old gate and the echo of my cousins laughing in the garden. I will never forget watching the sun go down behind the hills while she told us stories. One evening, I forgot to say goodbye when my parents took me home, and I still regret not hugging her that night. Now I must remember to call her every Sunday. Sometimes I close my eyes, and that porch is there again, small and golden, exactly as it was. Some memories stay vivid for ever.",
          "accepted": [
            "I remember standing on my grandmother's porch on hot summer evenings. The air was warm, and the scent of fresh bread came from the kitchen. I can still hear the creak of the old gate and the echo of my cousins laughing in the garden. I will never forget watching the sun go down behind the hills while she told us stories. One evening, I forgot to say goodbye when my parents took me home, and I still regret not hugging her that night. Now I must remember to call her every Sunday. Sometimes I close my eyes, and that porch is there again, small and golden, exactly as it was. Some memories stay vivid for ever.",
            "I remember playing in my grandfather's garden every summer. The air was warm, and the scent of apples was everywhere. I can still hear the creak of the wooden gate and the echo of his voice calling us for dinner. I will never forget eating under the big tree while he told funny stories. I regret not asking him more questions about his life, and I must remember to visit his house again this year. When I close my eyes, that garden comes back, small and green and full of light. It is a vivid memory that I do not want to forget."
          ]
        },
